WEBVTT

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:09.365
Block #7 damaged!

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:11.342
Normal propulsion section malfunction!

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:14.206
Detach the orbital shuttle!

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.180
It's no good, sir!
The computer's down!

00:00:16.482 --> 00:00:17.950
Switch over to manual control!

00:00:19.052 --> 00:00:20.417
It's away!

00:00:20.486 --> 00:00:23.046
Good. Now let's get ourselves
to the escape pods!

00:00:39.005 --> 00:00:40.973
Oh, my God...

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:55.855
And...
300 Years Later...

00:01:18.177 --> 00:01:21.374
| came to this land to protect you.

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:24.979
| was born to be with you.

00:01:25.351 --> 00:01:28.321
The moment I awoke...

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:32.424
...prisms surrounded me.

00:01:32.558 --> 00:01:36.017
I'm here to love you now.

00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:39.688
I was born to hold you.

00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:42.869
Lies and truths...

00:01:43.469 --> 00:01:46.996
...are all within ourselves.

00:01:47.874 --> 00:01:51.777
The days I abandon my true feelings...

00:01:52.145 --> 00:01:53.635
...won't get to me.

00:01:54.013 --> 00:01:57.039
Tenderness and caring...

00:01:57.583 --> 00:02:00.746
...can be ours once again!

00:02:01.054 --> 00:02:05.252
Day in, day out,
like a puppet on a string.

00:02:05.324 --> 00:02:09.124
Wandering in the void
between zero and infinity.

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:12.495
The strength to sever
the tangled wires...

00:02:12.565 --> 00:02:17.264
...is still sleeping inside of you.

00:02:51.971 --> 00:02:53.962
Who are you?

00:02:56.042 --> 00:02:58.238
Who are you...?

00:03:03.149 --> 00:03:05.447
Oh... it was a dream.

00:03:05.518 --> 00:03:07.486
OTARU MAMIYA! OUT!

00:03:12.225 --> 00:03:18.597
Enter Lime!
The Planet of Men

00:03:20.666 --> 00:03:23.567
AH! It's another
fine day in Japoness!

00:03:26.672 --> 00:03:29.266
It's October 1st, 7:00 am!

00:03:29.375 --> 00:03:31.469
And it's time for
"Gooood Morning, Japoness!”

00:03:31.544 --> 00:03:33.740
We have remarkably
good weather today...

00:03:33.813 --> 00:03:36.305
...but there is an 80%
chance of plasma clouds.

00:03:36.382 --> 00:03:38.874
Kite-flying is definitely
NOT recommended.

00:03:39.819 --> 00:03:43.050
Haw! You can't play shougi if
you're afraid of a little plasma!

00:03:43.589 --> 00:03:45.921
Fish, fish! Get your fresh fish!

00:03:45.992 --> 00:03:48.359
The freshest in all Japoness!

00:03:48.461 --> 00:03:49.860
Coming through!

00:03:49.929 --> 00:03:51.863
Bring some by my shop later!

00:03:51.931 --> 00:03:52.796
Yes, sir!

00:03:52.865 --> 00:03:54.731
Fish! Fresh fish!

00:03:55.034 --> 00:03:56.593
"Kasahari Apartments”
Oh, Otaru!

00:03:56.669 --> 00:03:57.761
Whoops!

00:03:57.837 --> 00:04:00.238
I heard you didn't
return last night.

00:04:00.306 --> 00:04:02.104
Uh, I'll pay the rent today.

00:04:02.175 --> 00:04:04.109
0-Oh, yeah! I got some
real good mackerels this time!

00:04:04.177 --> 00:04:05.804
Oh... Chubukura?

00:04:05.878 --> 00:04:06.936
But of course!

00:04:07.013 --> 00:04:09.812
- Whoa, it looks real!
- This is amazing!

00:04:09.882 --> 00:04:11.077
What?

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:13.812
Otaru! Come and see this!

00:04:13.886 --> 00:04:15.877
Sure! What is it, Old Gen?

00:04:15.955 --> 00:04:17.218
This! This!

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:20.260
The greatest purchase in the
life of Gennai Shiraga!

00:04:23.462 --> 00:04:26.557
This is Gemini, the
general-purpose marionette.

00:04:26.766 --> 00:04:28.427
Go on, say hi.

00:04:28.501 --> 00:04:31.801
My name is Gemini.
| am pleased to meet you.

00:04:32.071 --> 00:04:34.301
The... The pleasure's all mine.

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:36.269
Whatcha think, Otaru?

00:04:36.342 --> 00:04:39.141
I-It's great. She's kind of cute!

00:04:39.212 --> 00:04:40.873
- CUTE?
- Uh, yeah.

00:04:40.947 --> 00:04:43.678
Yo, Otaru? This is a marionette!

00:04:43.883 --> 00:04:45.715
I KNOW THAT!

00:04:45.785 --> 00:04:49.551
Otaru's got a thing
for marionettes!

00:04:50.489 --> 00:04:52.821
| do not, you old geezer"

00:04:53.859 --> 00:04:57.762
This new-type model cost
an arm and a leg, you know.

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:00.390
Yeah, whatever! I bet
you just rented it!

00:05:00.466 --> 00:05:03.527
It cost an arm and
a leg to RENT!

00:05:03.836 --> 00:05:05.463
See these legs?

00:05:05.538 --> 00:05:07.700
They say that if you
use them for a pillow...

00:05:07.773 --> 00:05:09.605
...it's like sleeping on a cloud!

00:05:10.343 --> 00:05:13.278
She even comes with an
ear-cleaning function!

00:05:13.346 --> 00:05:15.405
OH, MY GOD!

00:05:15.481 --> 00:05:18.781
That's the legendary
lap-pillow ear-cleaner!!!

00:05:18.985 --> 00:05:21.977
- Incredible!
- Ain't it, though!!

00:05:22.054 --> 00:05:24.955
Oh, nuts! My fish'll spoil!
Back to work!

00:05:30.763 --> 00:05:32.197
Watch it!!

00:05:32.265 --> 00:05:33.357
What the hell is that?!

00:05:33.432 --> 00:05:35.526
That's the idiot Joshuya boy.

00:05:35.768 --> 00:05:38.567
Master Mitsurugi! Such a
perfect driving technique!

00:05:39.272 --> 00:05:41.536
That goes without saying, Pinsuke.

00:05:41.607 --> 00:05:43.405
Thank you! Come again!

00:05:50.816 --> 00:05:51.783
Ow...

00:05:51.851 --> 00:05:53.546
Hey! Take that thing
somewhere else!

00:05:58.524 --> 00:06:00.014
You!

00:06:00.459 --> 00:06:04.089
What have we here?
If it isn't Otaru!

00:06:04.163 --> 00:06:08.225
Hanagata! You jerkface!
You destroyed my wares!

00:06:08.501 --> 00:06:10.162
What do you plan
to do about this?!

00:06:10.236 --> 00:06:12.967
WARES? Oh, that's so sad!

00:06:13.039 --> 00:06:15.167
It embarrasses me to
be your best friend!

00:06:15.241 --> 00:06:16.766
BEST FRIEND?

00:06:16.842 --> 00:06:20.676
I'm no friend of some stuck-up jerk
from some stuck-up country like you!

00:06:20.746 --> 00:06:23.044
Bite your tongue, you rogue!

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:27.620
It must be trying to
be so poor, Otaru.

00:06:27.687 --> 00:06:29.746
You should just leave this
work to your marionette...

00:06:29.822 --> 00:06:32.792
...and go and enjoy
life like I do.

00:06:32.858 --> 00:06:35.384
I forgot! You don't have
a marionette, do you!

00:06:35.461 --> 00:06:37.793
Shall I lend you
one of ours?

00:06:37.863 --> 00:06:40.662
MIND YOUR OWN BEESWAX!
| work because I like to!

00:06:40.733 --> 00:06:43.759
It's not my style to goof off while
marionettes do all the work!

00:06:43.836 --> 00:06:46.806
Selling wares is and always
will be a MAN'S job!

00:06:46.872 --> 00:06:49.898
Don't be so stubborn.
You need money, don't you?

00:06:49.975 --> 00:06:54.105
If that's the case I'll buy
all of your *UGH* fish.

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:57.445
Young Master! That's so magnanimous!
And, so generous.

00:06:57.616 --> 00:06:59.380
How much for the lot?

00:07:00.152 --> 00:07:01.381
Don't mock me!

00:07:01.454 --> 00:07:04.788
I'd sooner feed these
to PIGS than to you!

00:07:05.791 --> 00:07:07.987
| was only trying to be civil.

00:07:08.060 --> 00:07:11.587
| think you need to
be taught a lesson.

00:07:11.897 --> 00:07:13.592
You took the words
right outta my mouth!

00:07:13.666 --> 00:07:16.727
You always, always, ALWAYS
get in the way of my work!

00:07:16.802 --> 00:07:18.600
But today... Today,
I draw the line!

00:07:18.671 --> 00:07:20.298
Step outside!

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:22.599
Uh... We ARE outside...

00:07:39.225 --> 00:07:41.785
Don't hate me for this, Otaru.

00:07:41.861 --> 00:07:44.228
This is just another
form of friendship...

00:07:44.296 --> 00:07:45.388
PUT A LID ONIT!

00:07:45.464 --> 00:07:48.764
'Cause if you don't, I'll sprinkle
salt on your sorry ass and EAT it!

00:07:48.834 --> 00:07:50.427
You insolent little...

00:07:50.503 --> 00:07:52.267
Take him!

00:08:12.892 --> 00:08:15.054
Now it's just you and me, Hanagata.

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:25.166
Help!

00:08:25.237 --> 00:08:26.830
You did it, Master Mitsurugi!

00:08:26.906 --> 00:08:28.874
DIVE IN AFTER Him!

00:08:44.390 --> 00:08:45.789
Intruder spotted.

00:08:45.858 --> 00:08:47.758
She's heading southeast!

00:08:48.461 --> 00:08:49.929
Understood.

00:08:50.262 --> 00:08:52.060
She appears to be
a Gartlant spy...

00:08:52.131 --> 00:08:53.929
...but her objective
is still unclear.

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:55.834
Pursue and capture.

00:08:55.901 --> 00:08:56.891
Roger.

00:09:14.587 --> 00:09:16.419
Where am|...?

00:09:27.433 --> 00:09:30.425
"JAPONESS PIONEER MUSEUM"

00:09:35.941 --> 00:09:37.909
The Japoness Pioneer Museum?

00:09:59.064 --> 00:10:01.089
Welcome to the Japoness
Pioneer Museum.

00:10:02.568 --> 00:10:06.232
300 years ago, the interstellar
colonization transport, 'The Mesopotamia'...

00:10:06.305 --> 00:10:10.242
...had an accident, setting mankind
down on the surface of "Terra ll'.

00:10:10.309 --> 00:10:13.540
The only survivors were 6 males.

00:10:13.612 --> 00:10:15.239
In the 43rd year of Terra Il history...

00:10:15.314 --> 00:10:19.114
...leyasu Tokugawa The First
established the country of Japoness.

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:22.979
Oh, yeah...

00:10:23.055 --> 00:10:25.023
It was down that hall...

00:10:33.866 --> 00:10:36.392
"In the memory of
the human female."

00:10:41.874 --> 00:10:43.672
She sure is pretty.

00:10:54.053 --> 00:10:55.851
WHAT THE HELL?!?

00:11:05.864 --> 00:11:07.730
What's with this place...?!

00:11:11.036 --> 00:11:13.061
Where am I NOW?

00:12:29.281 --> 00:12:31.477
Is this some kind of marionette...?

00:12:35.054 --> 00:12:36.852
It looks almost alive.

00:12:50.235 --> 00:12:51.361
WHAT THE?!

00:13:10.989 --> 00:13:12.787
You.

00:13:14.159 --> 00:13:16.856
Who are you?

00:13:17.563 --> 00:13:19.861
Uh..er..I.

00:13:42.654 --> 00:13:44.622
"Eeeee"?

00:13:58.871 --> 00:14:00.839
Hey...!

00:14:03.408 --> 00:14:05.206
Are you okay?

00:14:06.411 --> 00:14:08.379
Snap out of it!

00:14:09.414 --> 00:14:11.382
Are you the one who woke me?

00:14:14.453 --> 00:14:16.444
Thanks! I'm Lime!

00:14:16.955 --> 00:14:17.922
Who are you?

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:20.789
Uh... My name's Otaru.
Otaru Mamiya.

00:14:20.859 --> 00:14:22.327
Otaru?

00:14:23.962 --> 00:14:26.158
I LOVE YOU, OTARUM

00:14:26.231 --> 00:14:27.858
H-Hey!

00:14:29.401 --> 00:14:31.665
What's with this marionette...?!

00:14:32.471 --> 00:14:35.930
<i>"AOIRYU MARTIAL ARTS"</i>

00:14:37.075 --> 00:14:37.940
Again!

00:14:38.544 --> 00:14:40.979
Otaru? Haven't seen him.

00:14:41.046 --> 00:14:42.036
Oh...

00:14:42.114 --> 00:14:44.879
Master Mitsurugi,
whatever is the matter?

00:14:44.950 --> 00:14:47.180
Why should you care
where that lousy kid is?

00:14:47.953 --> 00:14:49.785
EXACTLY! I'm not myself!

00:14:49.855 --> 00:14:52.984
Why am I getting all worked
up over that insolent cur?!

00:14:53.058 --> 00:14:54.822
| couldn't care less
what happens to him...

00:14:54.893 --> 00:14:58.124
...so why is my heart
SO RESTLESS?!

00:15:01.099 --> 00:15:02.589
Master Mitsurugi!

00:15:09.575 --> 00:15:11.566
"Fine Secondhand Clothing"

00:15:17.916 --> 00:15:19.714
How will I eat tomorrow...?

00:15:19.785 --> 00:15:22.777
Hey, Otaru! Whatcha think?
Whatcha think??

00:15:22.855 --> 00:15:24.414
Y-You look great.

00:15:27.259 --> 00:15:29.227
He said I look great.

00:15:30.963 --> 00:15:32.931
| look great!

00:15:32.998 --> 00:15:34.966
That comes to 105 mon.

00:15:35.033 --> 00:15:36.967
Would you let me have
them minus the tax?

00:15:37.035 --> 00:15:38.833
You look great!

00:15:40.005 --> 00:15:41.473
A puddle.

00:15:56.188 --> 00:15:57.656
Lime!

00:15:58.924 --> 00:16:01.416
That's Hanagata's motor-palanquin!

00:16:01.493 --> 00:16:02.961
You okay, Lime?

00:16:05.764 --> 00:16:08.392
But Otaru just said
I looked great...

00:16:08.934 --> 00:16:10.026
Lime?

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:13.038
You'll pay for this!!!

00:16:13.171 --> 00:16:14.639
Lime?!

00:16:17.209 --> 00:16:18.904
Wh--What the heck?!

00:16:20.846 --> 00:16:22.507
Come back here!!

00:16:23.949 --> 00:16:25.678
You won't get away!

00:16:52.077 --> 00:16:54.569
| am Baiko, Guard
of the Imperial Court.

00:16:56.915 --> 00:16:58.542
I am her partner, Tamasaburo.

00:17:00.719 --> 00:17:03.051
For what purpose have
you infiltrated Japoness?

00:17:04.222 --> 00:17:05.883
You're not very talkative.

00:17:05.958 --> 00:17:08.859
We'll just have to
analyze your data.

00:17:08.927 --> 00:17:10.554
Come along quietly!

00:17:15.334 --> 00:17:16.768
| can't shake her!

00:17:18.737 --> 00:17:20.831
But let's see if she
can match the speed...

00:17:20.906 --> 00:17:23.068
...of the Mitsurugi Hanagata
3000 GT at FULL POWERM

00:17:30.148 --> 00:17:31.115
WHAT???

00:17:31.450 --> 00:17:33.919
Where'd she go to?

00:17:35.921 --> 00:17:37.889
Hold it right there!!!

00:17:39.358 --> 00:17:41.019
Oh, Otaru! Yoo-hoo!

00:17:41.093 --> 00:17:42.390
Hey, where were you?

00:17:43.929 --> 00:17:46.899
NO MARIONETTE'S GOING
TO MAKE A FOOL OF ME"!

00:17:47.065 --> 00:17:48.897
Hanagata, you crazy jerk!

00:17:51.636 --> 00:17:52.398
LIME!

00:17:53.538 --> 00:17:54.664
Hmph!

00:18:19.531 --> 00:18:20.589
"Uncle!”

00:18:20.999 --> 00:18:21.932
Lime!

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:24.992
Otaru just told me that |
looked great! How dare you!

00:18:25.070 --> 00:18:27.164
Hanagata, just say you're sorry!

00:18:27.372 --> 00:18:28.464
YOU BLINKING IDIOT!!

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:31.999
Why should I apologize to
the likes of a marionette!?!

00:18:32.077 --> 00:18:34.136
What the hell IS
this thing, anyways?!

00:18:34.212 --> 00:18:36.704
Is her program full
of bugs or something?!

00:18:36.782 --> 00:18:37.943
Uh, well...

00:18:38.016 --> 00:18:39.575
Otaru, you eccentric!

00:18:39.651 --> 00:18:41.619
You acquired another piece
of junk for your collection!

00:18:41.686 --> 00:18:44.178
I'm not junk! I'm LIME!

00:19:19.691 --> 00:19:21.659
Look out! Run!

00:19:25.964 --> 00:19:28.262
The pursuit target has self-detonated.

00:19:28.333 --> 00:19:29.698
Very well. Return to base.

00:19:29.768 --> 00:19:30.701
As you wish.

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:36.840
Hanagata! What are
you doing?! Run!!

00:19:36.908 --> 00:19:38.535
|- can't move!

00:20:03.969 --> 00:20:05.437
Lime!

00:20:10.008 --> 00:20:11.976
You'll pay for this, Otaru!!

00:20:40.505 --> 00:20:42.633
Why does this happen to me?

00:20:43.642 --> 00:20:44.632
That's that.

00:20:45.177 --> 00:20:48.613
Whoa... This is no
ordinary marionette...

00:20:59.357 --> 00:21:02.850
H-Hey, Lime!
Lime! What's wrong?!

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:11.662
Oh, is THAT all...
She's just out of energy!

00:21:11.736 --> 00:21:13.704
I got all worried for nothing.

00:21:18.109 --> 00:21:21.477
This marionette
sure is screwy...

00:21:21.546 --> 00:21:23.742
I've never seen one that
laughs or gets mad before...

00:21:24.482 --> 00:21:25.881
Now she even talks
in her sleep.

00:21:26.918 --> 00:21:28.886
I love you, Otaru...

00:21:31.590 --> 00:21:33.285
<i>.Ne you...</i>

00:21:35.026 --> 00:21:36.994
Oh, well!

00:21:57.616 --> 00:22:01.177
When you're sad, when you're blue...

00:22:01.386 --> 00:22:05.084
...don't go off to be alone.

00:22:05.290 --> 00:22:08.055
Just think of me...

00:22:08.126 --> 00:22:12.757
...and I'll be there with you.

00:22:13.031 --> 00:22:16.695
Strength is a very important thing...

00:22:16.768 --> 00:22:20.466
...but tears are important, too.

00:22:20.639 --> 00:22:24.405
You can't do anything at all...

00:22:24.476 --> 00:22:26.171
...with a dried-up heart.

00:22:26.244 --> 00:22:30.238
You can't feel a thing.

00:22:32.317 --> 00:22:34.684
Tell me, why do people hide...

00:22:34.753 --> 00:22:39.691
...what they really feel inside?

00:22:39.891 --> 00:22:43.521
Take what you can do,
what you want to do...

00:22:43.728 --> 00:22:47.323
...one step at a time.

00:22:47.565 --> 00:22:51.263
I love the way you don't care...

00:22:51.336 --> 00:22:55.034
...how you have been
programmed to live.

00:22:55.206 --> 00:22:58.767
| would follow you anywhere.

00:22:59.144 --> 00:23:05.106
I'll never, ever let you go.

00:23:15.960 --> 00:23:17.189
Yoo-hoo! It's me, Lime!

00:23:17.262 --> 00:23:19.663
Everyone keeps
calling me "defective."

00:23:19.731 --> 00:23:21.825
Why? Is there something
wrong with me?

00:23:21.900 --> 00:23:24.835
What?! Hanagata's little
brother was trapped by thieves...

00:23:24.903 --> 00:23:27.270
...and left inside of
a burning building?!

00:23:27.339 --> 00:23:29.307
I'll go, Otaru.

00:23:29.374 --> 00:23:31.866
After all, I'm just a...
just a...

00:23:32.577 --> 00:23:37.224
Marionette Girl: The Troublemaker
Next on Saber Marionette J!

00:23:37.248 --> 00:23:39.060
Marionette Girl: The
Troublemaker I love you, Otaru!

00:23:39.084 --> 00:23:39.744
I love you, Otaru!
